  "id": "applied-behavior-analysis",
  "term": "applied behavior analysis",
  "definition": "Applied behavior analysis is the use of behavioral science to improve socially important problems, including behavior and learning difficulties. In people with intellectual and developmental disabilities, including autism, its methods may be organized as comprehensive or focused approaches.",
